[0.086609, "o", "\u001b[1;36m== Negotiation + convergence (single-pane mux) ==\u001b[0m\r\nReading all three serial ports concurrently for ~8s and prefixing lines with [A]/[B]/[C].\r\nExpected: C prints NODE_A/NODE_B and ends with DEMO_PASS=1.\r\n\r\n"]
